        "Reborn Dolls 2008-2019",
        "Here are some of the reborn dolls I have created in the last 14 years, including many prototypes for other sculpting artists. In most recent years I have focused a lot more of my time on my sculpting work and so my reborning has taken a back seat. Unfortunately I do not take custom orders. When new babies become available I add them to my online store. Join my mailer to be notified of new available reborn dolls."
